{%- comment -%} Refurbished vs certified pre-owned explainer. {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="wt page-width" id="refurbished-vs-certified-pre-owned">
  <p class="wt__eyebrow">Two ways to save</p>
  <h2 class="wt__h">Refurbished or certified pre-owned?</h2>
  <p class="wt__sub">Both are tested, graded and backed by our 1-year warranty and free 30-day returns. The difference is what the device needed before it reached you.</p>
  <div class="wt__grid">
    <div class="wt-card">
      <span class="wt-card__tag">Refurbished</span>
      <h3>Restored by our technicians</h3>
      <p>Devices that needed work. We replace what's worn or broken, like the battery, screen or back glass, then test everything.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Parts replaced where needed</li>
        <li>Battery at 80% health or higher</li>
        <li>Lowest prices</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="wt-card wt-card--cpo">
      <span class="wt-card__tag">Certified pre-owned</span>
      <h3>Lightly used, checked and certified</h3>
      <p>Devices in great shape that didn't need repairs. We inspect, clean and certify them as they are.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>All original parts</li>
        <li>Light or no signs of use</li>
        <li>Closest thing to new</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
